 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Your Windows 11 PC is slow, and it's not your fault.",
   "s": 0.06,
   "e": 3.544
  },
  {
   "text": "Here are six free fixes, no extra apps needed.",
   "s": 3.964,
   "e": 6.833
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay for fix six, most people skip it.",
   "s": 7.253,
   "e": 9.613
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix one: press Control, Shift and Escape to open Task Manager.",
   "s": 10.033,
   "e": 13.997
  },
  {
   "text": "Click Startup apps.",
   "s": 14.417,
   "e": 15.494
  },
  {
   "text": "Select an app you don't need, and click Disable.",
   "s": 15.914,
   "e": 18.46
  },
  {
   "text": "Now it won't launch every time you sign in.",
   "s": 18.88,
   "e": 20.94
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix two: click Processes, then the CPU column.",
   "s": 21.36,
   "e": 24.448
  },
  {
   "text": "The busiest app jumps to the top.",
   "s": 24.868,
   "e": 26.484
  },
  {
   "text": "If you don't need it, select it and click End task.",
   "s": 26.904,
   "e": 29.611
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix three: is your taskbar frozen?",
   "s": 30.031,
   "e": 32.024
  },
  {
   "text": "Select Windows Explorer, and click Restart task.",
   "s": 32.444,
   "e": 35.45
  },
  {
   "text": "The taskbar reloads without restarting your PC.",
   "s": 35.87,
   "e": 38.404
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix four: open Settings, Accessibility, Visual effects.",
   "s": 38.824,
   "e": 42.332
  },
  {
   "text": "Turn off Animation effects and Transparency effects.",
   "s": 42.752,
   "e": 45.75
  },
  {
   "text": "Menus open without the extra motion.",
   "s": 46.17,
   "e": 48.282
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix five: go to System, Storage, Storage Sense.",
   "s": 48.702,
   "e": 51.389
  },
  {
   "text": "Turn it on, and pick how often it runs.",
   "s": 51.809,
   "e": 53.861
  },
  {
   "text": "It clears temporary files for you, automatically.",
   "s": 54.281,
   "e": 56.961
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix six: open Apps, then Installed apps.",
